{"id":"n37731-2-4","stage":2,"title":"깜박하다 · 眨巴","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n37731-2-4-1","ko":"눈을 깜박할 때마다 속눈썹이 자꾸 눈을 찔러요.","zh":"我每次眨眼，睫毛就会不停地戳到眼睛。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"눈을","meaning":"眼睛","explanation":"눈：眼睛；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"눈","audio":"/audio/ab1b14816087979d2143.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72704","senseId":"1","lemma":"눈","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"깜박할","meaning":"眨巴，一眨","explanation":"깜박하다：眨巴，一眨；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"깜박하다","audio":"/audio/7cd6e59695e222c286cb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"37731","senseId":"2","lemma":"깜박하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"때마다","meaning":"时，时候","explanation":"때：时，时候；마다：表示“每、每逢”。","readings":[{"term":"때","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74123","senseId":"1","lemma":"때","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"속눈썹이","meaning":"睫毛","explanation":"속눈썹：睫毛；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"속눈썹","audio":"/audio/f7b44879c55821ec3551.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64205","senseId":"1","lemma":"속눈썹","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"자꾸","meaning":"一直，总是","explanation":"자꾸：一直，总是","readings":[{"term":"자꾸","audio":"/audio/d28ff63a0382ce4fce6d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70796","senseId":"1","lemma":"자꾸","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"눈을","meaning":"眼睛","explanation":"눈：眼睛；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"눈","audio":"/audio/ab1b14816087979d2143.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72704","senseId":"1","lemma":"눈","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"찔러요.","meaning":"刺，捅，扎","explanation":"찌르다：刺，捅，扎；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"찌르다","audio":"/audio/0fb4e786abddd81c7cf7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71364","senseId":"1","lemma":"찌르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"ab1b14816087979d","term":"눈","zh":"眼睛","audio":"/audio/ab1b14816087979d2143.mp3","entryId":"72704","definition":"人或动物的一种感觉器官，位于脸部，受光线刺激后能看到物体。","pronunciation":["눈"]},{"id":"7cd6e59695e222c2","term":"깜박하다","zh":"眨巴，一眨","audio":"/audio/7cd6e59695e222c286cb.mp3","entryId":"37731","definition":"眼睛闭一会儿后再睁开；或使那样。","pronunciation":["깜바카다"]},{"id":"43bc9c47e0f938b1","term":"때","zh":"时，时候","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3","entryId":"74123","definition":"指某一瞬间或时间段。","pronunciation":["때"]},{"id":"f7b44879c55821ec","term":"속눈썹","zh":"睫毛","audio":"/audio/f7b44879c55821ec3551.mp3","entryId":"64205","definition":"长在眼睑边缘上的毛发。","pronunciation":["송ː눈썹"]},{"id":"d28ff63a0382ce4f","term":"자꾸","zh":"一直，总是","audio":"/audio/d28ff63a0382ce4fce6d.mp3","entryId":"70796","definition":"多次连续地。","pronunciation":["자꾸"]},{"id":"0fb4e786abddd81c","term":"찌르다","zh":"刺，捅，扎","audio":"/audio/0fb4e786abddd81c7cf7.mp3","entryId":"71364","definition":"用末端尖锐或锋利的物品用力向里推，导致某物表面被穿破或深深地凹陷下去。","pronunciation":["찌르다"]}],"audio":"/audio/e5e88c8ce5497908b4ab.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n37731-2-4-2","ko":"저런, 눈이 많이 아팠겠군요.","zh":"哎呀，眼睛一定很疼吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"저런,","meaning":"啊，哎呀","explanation":"저런：啊，哎呀","readings":[{"term":"저런","audio":"/audio/2f66dcda6095507e43b6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71224","senseId":"1","lemma":"저런","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"눈이","meaning":"眼睛","explanation":"눈：眼睛；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"눈","audio":"/audio/ab1b14816087979d2143.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72704","senseId":"1","lemma":"눈","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"많이","meaning":"多","explanation":"많이：多","readings":[{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66030","senseId":"1","lemma":"많이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아팠겠군요.","meaning":"疼， 痛，不舒服","explanation":"아프다：疼， 痛，不舒服；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；군요：对新发现或新理解的情况表示礼貌的感叹。","readings":[{"term":"아프다","audio":"/audio/912c6f176a189a346579.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62239","senseId":"1","lemma":"아프다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"2f66dcda6095507e","term":"저런","zh":"啊，哎呀","audio":"/audio/2f66dcda6095507e43b6.mp3","entryId":"71224","definition":"听到没料到的、惊奇或可惜的事情时说的词语。","pronunciation":["저런"]},{"id":"ab1b14816087979d","term":"눈","zh":"眼睛","audio":"/audio/ab1b14816087979d2143.mp3","entryId":"72704","definition":"人或动物的一种感觉器官，位于脸部，受光线刺激后能看到物体。","pronunciation":["눈"]},{"id":"1af2aeb1be04021c","term":"많이","zh":"多","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3","entryId":"66030","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准地。","pronunciation":["마ː니"]},{"id":"912c6f176a189a34","term":"아프다","zh":"疼， 痛，不舒服","audio":"/audio/912c6f176a189a346579.mp3","entryId":"62239","definition":"因受伤或生病，而感到痛症或痛苦。","pronunciation":["아프다"]}],"audio":"/audio/16b842f571ce21f4c072.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.553,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=37731","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"중급","day":82,"sequenceScore":2.2783,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["哎呀，眼睛一定很疼吧。","我每次眨眼，睫毛就会不停地戳到眼睛。","有什么烦恼吗？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["我每次眨眼，睫毛就会不停地戳到眼睛。","有什么烦恼吗？","哎呀，眼睛一定很疼吧。"],"answer":2}]}
